WEBVTT

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:09.000
(TRYES SCREECH) (HORN BLARES)
(BICYCLE BELL RINGS)

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:11.120
Hey, I'm walking here!

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:14.280
Wow!

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:18.320
Whoo! Here we go.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:20.720
(BRAKES SCREECH)

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:22.840
(DOOR BELL JANGLES)

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:26.280
(SHOP MUSIC PLAYS)

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:30.520
Excuse me. Sir?

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:31.880
(GROWLS)

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:35.720
I was just wondering
if "you're... no good"?

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:37.120
(GROWLS)

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.160
You're good! My mistake!

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.200
(SQUELCH) (GRUNTS)

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:44.440
Oh, oh! Oh, sorry.
I didn't mean to scare you.

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:48.440
I was just, uh, trying out
this new invention of mine.

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:52.720
I call it "Sticky Fingers"
or "Smart Goo."

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:55.760
I-I-I, I haven't quite
landed on the name yet.

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:56.920
QUIETLY: Come here.

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:04.240
I overheard you were
looking for something... special.

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:09.320
Ah, yes. I was hoping
"YOU'RE NO GOOD."

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:12.120
(LAUGHS)

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:16.400
I think you'll enjoy
listening in booth three.

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:21.360
Right this way.
(LAUGHS EXCITEDLY)

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:26.680
(LAUGHS) (SPEAKS MINIONESE)
(LAUGHS) (MUFFLED)

00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:28.720
(CLASSICAL MUSIC)

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:31.040
(ROCK MUSIC)

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:35.200
This is it. Mum's the word.
Keep it down. Good luck.

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:37.200
Let 'em have it, son.

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:40.560
Thanks, Mr... Nefario.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:43.760
That's DOCTOR Nefario.

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:45.920
Here, take this.
Uh...

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:47.200
If you ever get famous,

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:50.040
remember who gave you
your first gadget. (CHUCKLES)

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:51.400
OK.

00:01:55.560 --> 00:01:58.600
# ..wouldn't blame him
If he said to me

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:01.840
# You're no good
You're no good, you're no good... #

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:04.720
(KNOCKS)
Try backwards.

00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:07.800
Ah.
# ..play it again... #

00:02:09.040 --> 00:02:11.800
Welcome to the... Vicious Six.

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:13.360
Whoa!
# You're no... #

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:15.680
That is pretty coo... Whoa!

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:17.720
(LEVELS DING) (SCREAMS) (THUD)

00:02:21.760 --> 00:02:23.480
(SCRAPING)

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:27.400
Hello.
(CHUCKLES NERVOUSLY)

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:31.560
(CLEARS THROAT)

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:35.280
Everybody here for the interview?

00:02:35.320 --> 00:02:36.880
(SCRAPING)
Me too.

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:40.000
So, what do you guys
got going on later?

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:43.600
Are you up to no good?
You gonna get into some mischief?

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:47.800
OK.

00:02:47.840 --> 00:02:50.280
(RADIO CRACKLES)
Send the first one in.

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:54.440
They're ready to see you, Mr Gru.
Oh, good.

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:57.320
Great. Oh!
(CHUCKLES NERVOUSLY)

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:01.320
(DOORS OPEN LOUDLY) (GASPS)

00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:07.960
(ECHOEY FOOTSTEPS)
Hmm.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.520
(DOORS CLOSE LOUDLY)

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:12.920
(GASPS)

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:19.920
(SLOW, SINISTER MUSIC)

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:22.960
(CLEARS THROAT)

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:28.560
HIGH PITCHED:
Distinguished villains,

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:30.720
my name is Gru.

00:03:31.720 --> 00:03:36.080
I feel like I'm talking too loud,
even though our proximity

00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:40.480
doesn't require
this kind of (ECHOING) volume.

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:44.040
(CLEARS THROAT)

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:47.640
If you told me when I was 10
that I would have the chance

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:50.640
to fill the shoes
of my favourite villain ever...

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:51.920
Wild Knuckles,

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:55.200
I would say,
you got rocks in your head.

00:03:55.240 --> 00:03:57.760
But now that
I'm 11 and three quarters,

00:03:57.800 --> 00:03:59.480
it makes a lot more sense!

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:04.320
All right, who let the kid in?
I thought he was a tiny man.

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:07.040
What's wrong with you?

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:11.520
You seriously think a puny little
child can be a villain?

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:17.160
Um, yes. I-I am pretty despicable.
You don't want to cross me.

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:20.320
Evil is for adults

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:23.880
who steal powerful ancient stones
and wreak havoc.

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:25.040
(GASPS)

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:29.760
And not for tubby little punks
who should be at school,

00:04:29.800 --> 00:04:34.920
learning, taking a recess,
sucking his thumb.

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:37.240
(LAUGHTER)
Sucking his...

00:04:37.280 --> 00:04:38.880
(GIGGLES)

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:41.920
Come back when you've done something
to impress me.

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:43.640
Who's next?

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:48.640
I am Wing Man,
the next member of the Vicious Six.

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:52.280
Behold, the power of flight!

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:55.480
(BOOM)
Argh, argh! Fire!

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:58.400
All right, joke's over. Showtime.

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:01.640
(WHOOSHING)
(WHIMPERS)

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:03.760
Ugh! This is a big one.
(GRUNTS)

00:05:06.520 --> 00:05:07.880
Yeah. To the left, that's right.

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:10.400
(FAST-PACED ACTION MUSIC)

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:12.680
(CLICKS)

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:14.440
(SPLAT)

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:16.800
(GRUNTS)

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:21.720
(GRAND, DRAMATIC MUSIC)

00:05:24.600 --> 00:05:27.920
Bring him in! Bring him in, boys!
Everybody pile on!

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:30.160
(GRUNTS)
(GASPS)

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:32.120
He took the stone!

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:34.560
I'll get him!
(GROWLS) (GRUNTS)

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:37.600
Oh! Ha!
(GRUNTS REPEATEDLY)

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:41.240
Lock down the building!
(YELLS)

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:42.720
(LIFT WHIRS) (DINGS)

00:05:42.760 --> 00:05:44.600
(LAUGHS EXCITEDLY)

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:46.320
Oh!
(GASPS)

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:48.880
(ALARM WAILS) (CUSTOMERS MUTTER)

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:52.280
I d... I di...
Nothing to see here.

00:05:52.320 --> 00:05:54.880
Oh, look at you.
Frampton Comes Alive!

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:56.640
Nice choice.
(THUD) (GASPS)

00:05:56.680 --> 00:06:00.080
(SLOW, SINISTER MUSIC)
I, uh...

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:02.280
Just keep walking.

